{"number":104,"name":"سُورَةُ الهُمَزَةِ","englishName":"Al-Humaza","englishNameTranslation":"The Traducer","revelationType":"Meccan","numberOfAyahs":9,"hasBasmalaPrefix":false,"ayahs":[{"g":6180,"i":1,"ar":"وَيْلٌۭ لِّكُلِّ هُمَزَةٍۢ لُّمَزَةٍ","tr":"Woe to every scorner and mocker","tl":"Wai lul-li kulli hu mazatil-lumaza"},{"g":6181,"i":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى جَمَعَ مَالًۭا وَعَدَّدَهُۥ","tr":"Who collects wealth and [continuously] counts it.","tl":"Al-lazi jama'a maalaw wa'addadah"},{"g":6182,"i":3,"ar":"يَحْسَبُ أَنَّ مَالَهُۥٓ أَخْلَدَهُۥ","tr":"He thinks that his wealth will make him immortal.","tl":"Yahsabu anna maalahu akhladah"},{"g":6183,"i":4,"ar":"كَلَّا ۖ لَيُنۢبَذَنَّ فِى ٱلْحُطَمَةِ","tr":"No! He will surely be thrown into the Crusher.","tl":"Kalla layum ba zanna fil hutamah"},{"g":6184,"i":5,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحُطَمَةُ","tr":"And what can make you know what is the Crusher?","tl":"Wa maa adraaka mal-hutamah"},{"g":6185,"i":6,"ar":"نَارُ ٱللَّهِ ٱلْمُوقَدَةُ","tr":"It is the fire of Allah, [eternally] fueled,","tl":"Narul laahil-mooqada"},{"g":6186,"i":7,"ar":"ٱلَّتِى تَطَّلِعُ عَلَى ٱلْأَفْـِٔدَةِ","tr":"Which mounts directed at the hearts.","tl":"Al latee tat tali'u 'alalafidah"},{"g":6187,"i":8,"ar":"إِنَّهَا عَلَيْهِم مُّؤْصَدَةٌۭ","tr":"Indeed, Hellfire will be closed down upon them","tl":"Innaha 'alaihim moosada"},{"g":6188,"i":9,"ar":"فِى عَمَدٍۢ مُّمَدَّدَةٍۭ","tr":"In extended columns.","tl":"Fee 'amadim-mu mad dadah"}]}